      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "二、JVM 垃圾收集器选型"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "二jvm-垃圾收集器选型"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Java 8 中比较主流的 GC 算法有 Parallel GC、CMS、G1 三种（Serial 一般仅用于客户端或单核场景）。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.1 Serial（串行）收集器"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "21-serial串行收集器"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "类型：bool"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "声明方式：-XX:[+/-]UseSerialGC"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "说明：在 JDK 1.3.1 之前是唯一选择。单线程收集，GC 时必须 Stop-The-World（暂停所有工作线程）。简单高效，适合单 CPU 或客户端小应用。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.2 Parallel（并行）收集器"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "22-parallel并行收集器"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "类型：bool"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "声明方式：-XX:[+/-]UseParallelGC、-XX:[+/-]UseParallelOldGC"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "说明：又称「吞吐量收集器」。使用多线程完成垃圾清理，能充分利用多核大幅降低 GC 时间。是 Java 8 的默认 GC。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.3 CMS（并发）收集器"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "23-cms并发收集器"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "类型：bool"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "声明方式：-XX:[+/-]UseParNewGC、-XX:[+/-]UseConcMarkSweepGC"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "说明：以「最短停顿时间」为目标。Minor GC 时暂停所有应用线程，多线程回收；Full GC 时用若干后台线程并发扫描老年代，不再整体暂停应用线程。JDK 9 起已标记废弃，JDK 14 移除。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.4 G1（并发）收集器"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "24-g1并发收集器"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "类型：bool"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "声明方式：-XX:[+/-]UseG1GC"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "说明：设计初衷是处理超大堆（>4GB），将堆划分为多个 Region 优先回收垃圾最多的区域。相对 CMS 的优势是内存碎片率显著降低，停顿时间可预测（-XX:MaxGCPauseMillis 控制目标）。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.5 选型总结"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "25-选型总结"
        }
      },
